{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 955,
  "batch_count": 1662,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "c0513553da490a692523f45b5f779f99f6cb7e34",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c8632b32f8b121ad7fb9a14",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中段以后的直线位于领头时\\n长时间内速度持续微量提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ca0206d408d51147ece4fed46a2b240a3d3fe70b744534cab32c49ba3bfd61d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910641"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ba9963062b5e91721cf0281",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛序盘位于前方竞争时\\n速度稍微提升,若是英里比赛\\n则消耗体力使速度少量提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c08c0a97d6c69d6c0f0d1ef3683d228a29aba11fb86f4ccfe984c6d00fb96ea",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910651"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e3e85292193964e50103e68",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中段附近位于中间集团时\\n稍微提升速度\\n并回复微量体力",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffbafc1ec498c6548fdf299d8f810b7fefd1225503ed70eebd873e940ed534c4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910671"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90e3782fa40bf0411c9126a6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在终盘的弯道处位于前方,且距离终点尚远时\\n短时间内稍微向前突进\\n并提升略微加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d801f97a7be97cc8fafe19f6aa68e8168fbc5ccf583773ba15a492160d84389",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910681"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:489f4b0e8809cf448a0d556e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "如果在比赛中盘展开竞争\\n且在剩下650m处处于好位置\\n则稍微持续提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "61b5333c4420c1d160ee594fe52657a1ad14e2870ac51bccc7ace2e1e265153f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910691"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6c983cb411352106164dacb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛将近一半时若位于中间位置\\n则速度持续极少量提升\\n若是中距离比赛且力量有十二分强劲\\n则速度长时间持续极少量提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6f931327ddd61ef87af925cab749e276c3bb84ef0df0207f8ee862be79b03bb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910701"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf7f7eb7207e6a72c2b18755",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘的最终直线处于好位置且身后的\\n马娘接近时,消耗少量体力,速度\\n稍微上升并向前极小幅突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3bb93d2b70e81747e348980984bc59e4403016025dfdfe5e4b2c01ee37c0b8e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910711"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa5a4751d3f244901ed5b5cf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若在比赛中段前后进行竞争\\n则在比赛后半段随机位置\\n稍微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "430fbce3af67766c7f5067b924fb04f1db4f594a6b34d34f844bf6d454cb9e71",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910721"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:569382cd7d4f63072d9b3ce9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "中盘位于队伍中间时稍微放慢速度\\n并回复少量体力,当耐力有\\n十二分充足时,之后在终盘\\n会长时间持续向前极小幅度突击",
      "source_fingerprint": "14c3323da2379564821ba17f6e59d33d60e488b464be8974f1e9af46acb9c351",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910741"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:383d9a6428c22cbefae10f36",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "终盘的最终弯道后半段位于中团时\n稍微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fe94ced0fa290e496600c1727aae0f2dbdff8f6e74698a242f67d8ada412179",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910761"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b40b4df15eda6b0676af7a3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘初期用技能回复了耐力\\n并在比赛中段往后位于好位置时\\n速度略微提升,若距离终点非常远\\n则变为速度少量提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8d1b721bdf8d90de1d2bed8a8291e9f93b2154b2502416f503f6ac5d597f461",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910771"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f26c649b8f933b3b81fe0c4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛剩余350m的位置位于前方时\\n短时间内稍微向前突进,若是英里比赛\\n则额外极少量增加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c3318708a7c9c705f6e65c08ef0febed096522a07e6b66208845fd588e1176a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910781"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc1a752ca2c6b118bb945750",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近中盘时若位于前方则会在短时间内\\n少量提升速度，之后在比赛中段\\n附近被紧追时会少量向前冲出\\n＜泥地＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "5927919571e9800b21f9f4827a23eb593c74e9959fbbb9429ce85764f1df6468",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910801"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eba16272b039c074b06b5bb6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半阶段若位于中间集团以后\\n一段时间内速度微幅提升\\n若在英里比赛中一直保持在后方\\n则速度持续微幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fbb05c8b2eae411968cfee9506ee2fe52b57e2e2a952d2ea256fea53ec35927",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910821"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9096765037e54f3f5ef29e77",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛进行到一半位于队伍中间时\\n在最终直线处稍微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "f29b2efcc759c46d5acb2e3e87c71d4d31ccbe19cf91ebc0dde1a2a38deab5b6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910831"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b36a2f46087dd2e1275dbc9b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘位于后方时,极小幅向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "5934e9477c702215a05f84318c7335480a373ef70be36013c63e754b2ef34be0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910841"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:927112cb84a6ab848c8af19d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛进行一半左右若位于中间位置\\n则速度略微提升,如果是英里比赛\\n则进一步增加效果和持续时间",
      "source_fingerprint": "68477eb428f9f2c51c1efa8db7996c4f9693a2bdd9fe7a20d695ea6ba49b3e99",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910851"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52f0bca95da3ee9997c9cd91",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "剩余300m的位置位于前方时\\n速度稍微提升,发动技能时\\n若位于领头或距离领头2马身以内\\n则速度大幅提升＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "86146154afdc92a24531e9ae60da2b65cd8867938dd92f7c927bd1d0f908e12a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910861"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6588238cd9a03303269cb495",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "短距离比赛的赛程近半若位于前方\\n则速度稍微提升,若智力有十二分高超\\n则少量提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "2de14abef7f05d47f58379a51091b9e558f105b29594b5b7d462f0dd277b639e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910871"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:484522f967e32f6609d3d26a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘初期进行超越时\\n短时间内小幅向前突进＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "222a7022d6a33ab26f1d4adcc4b2be4c4bbc263b1573a8019637c56def4a5ba0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910881"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8197cf5da112f2b2249f250",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中程附近若位于中间位置\\n则长时间略微提升速度,并稍微回复耐力＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "672a4b18125fec6f7bae35dde9b6d7a962fa54c9bd6a1947b04060a9f2e50f82",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910891"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdc7ae23289a01bf8725ae00",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛后半段的第3弯道位于\\n中间位置时,速度少量提升\\n若是2000m的比赛且此时是上坡\\n提升技能效果与持续时间",
      "source_fingerprint": "96d9b80674c0e07708a91965603d41a4644b40dd82c6a7ead4f055cc28dd7724",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910911"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91b85c3c40437f5efc4448ad",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘在队伍中游进行过竞争时\\n最终冲刺时速度稍微提升,若是短距离比赛\\n且在技能发动时位于前三名\\n则额外极小幅向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "55fdca82ef98634700bb44221320acf8567b00d8b0a136a2f3bf41ef16e2da84",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910931"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9aeb1960666d942d98b87d37",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘在中间集团及以后发生切磋时\n速度稍微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e8f1d4a190122042681a29846a8c8e52227048d5f6c461e7f35b1dbb574f0f1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910941"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:833bbe272e6eeebf81b170b6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘位于前方时\\n若距离终点尚远则稍微向前突进＜沙土＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "a922913649ba461c03d73a5452222ee7b6cf6fb904d25580dab0cd0345aec860",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910981"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b195774b846907f0e7054969",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛半程略微提升速度\\n且在沙土比赛发动技能时\\n若不在第3弯道\\n则额外提升极少量速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "063ad0893ceb4fe72f5daa1d4ca9784eae9e056ce236f29bca7efe944f60634a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910991"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc568b95ff6d919d5ef5a26e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘初期位于第3名及以后\n且正前方或正后方长时间有赛马娘时\n短暂稍微向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b7d1740c140be309160cf796675d321c12ad7676741982ca2d247270c8f8470",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "911001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e68db14c2110bad1d41ab481",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段持续稍微提升速度\n若是2000m以上的比赛，\n之后会在最后冲刺阶段短暂\n稍微提升加速度<居中/后追>",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6504e5d43abf9aaa1ccc15d89c919e36c8a368fe5cc7a14d283fe763bafee99",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "91101351"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c20faa2fc255f43cf1aefb17",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛后半段一段时间内略微提升速度\\n若是2000m以上的比赛,则在此之后\\n于最后冲刺阶段短暂地\\n略微提升加速度＜领放/先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "0dd470c8c9c59f55e219fc947539861b2fc67f52121dcdb847c4ce4436d945fd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "91101411"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bcba5bff7960ff22f6af0e2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段为止保持在前方的话\n在终盘的最终直线略微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "672f39f8aca482e29c6653e05f5489985f348672a6fb8ddc7ddebbd2f7444df0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "911021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c35715c618e6e46f35a9228",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "中距离比赛的前半段若能保持\\n名次位于前方,则长时间内速度持续极少量提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "437da4a84367e08eb44461eb0aeb303baec94f4c16c1ff2f457a0d2a69273947",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "911041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:033a3bb192ecfeb5b95d07a1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在终盘的最终直线位于第二名开外\\n则速度稍微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "67c32695364b4ede170117e3f059f7e71657b8e590ea270ffe1b35c0b64ef32d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "911051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d319fc7a44c626a9420912a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘准备超越时\\n\n短时间内略微向前突进,之后在\\n\n终盘的最终弯道后半位于中后方时\\n\n短时间内速度稍微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ea67e092eee4661c1af659d2976fa43c8bd3e7d856343b3ade5f79c855d6dcc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "911061"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0328bc4cf561eb026e5f662",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "终盘逼近时若处于前方\\n持续小幅度提升速度\\n若在前三名内则持续小幅度增加加速度＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9f4a7772838b9333c0458b90ef5e26b3a0fa740f7af398e6fc6ec304c45a5f8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "911071"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f73ee44f43f2a4af4ca0bece",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若是三后冠的赛道\\n则在终盘的弯道短时间内极小幅向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f26678dfe70578e75783fad29a2c2afa514b43c218f30e59b112ea21fbf84ee",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "911091"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d995aa7ae485c6feb1bda58",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终冲刺时短时间内速度少量提升＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "371107a5a576ecdab07cb3018fd668dfb9a70d15813debcacfe5fef0a5b453cc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "911101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa2b2c68f04f46e59155fff9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘位于前方\\n被靠近时,速度稍微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fe7dc055f945390ecdada13e98aadaace5a8e70d2120e3b99a68bee80471a1e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "911131"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc76ed165e65951fcb814ea5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中间点位于中团时\\n在剩余400m处速度稍微提升\\n技能发动时若处于有利位置\\n则效果提升＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f826ae479ff531b7cb20cadb5e60644e16d524ddc018673cc0557f308f93c95",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "911161"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6589747a599e5c518c389da",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "剩余1000m地点位于后方时短暂\n少许向前突进，若是长距离比赛，之后\n若在终盘的弯道有过超越\n则在最终直线短暂稍微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "992a1ec6f5c50b9cbb4154ec1836fab24bb39e9a1fdaec20d7a4146a4412e42a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "911191"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bddffcbc74563812df243d90",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "终盘的最终弯道后半段位于前方时\n短暂少许向前突进<作战·先行>",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef782201963709871bdc166ccc4ab3bd807062a6baf6c47a513cf4c71e1ac992",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "911241"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:426b27413fab8d485aa720ec",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在终盘及以后的最终弯道后半段位于前方时\\n稍微向前突进\\n若在比赛后半段被逼近\\n则稍微向前突进＜中距离/长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "45ee38ed6434698d5bcac58a6146dbed8d85252919b1092b02b2a9eeb63350ec",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "911271"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c939f110fd7edce1a5e8b88",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘的直线上若身处前方\\n一段时间内速度持续微幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c98edac725ce210bb87190b4d99202a9d0df673a5e3b366417d6a3d8812d57a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "911321"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:895c8205ed7d2668907f03ac",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在终盘最终弯道发动技能后\\n速度稍微提升\\n处于中山竞马场的话,速度少量提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "667f63aa3574a83403a486a37c2fb031945866dc26b58f9a8f8302e5c555ffb3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "920011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ce84431f098f39dea76a4dd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段在前方被逼近时\\n在终盘的最终弯道后半以及往后会稍微提升速度\\n如果比赛距离为2400m～2500m\\n则额外向前极小幅度突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "8eea9704bb96ea6901e9ae1aaa414f7e818d56f1418ca0e599cb10c6bd2a3925",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "920031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f18c1f803ba648bf8af8bb2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘初期位于前方时\\n若准备超越或者被逼近\\n则短时间内极小幅向前突进\\n如果是英里比赛则短时间内小幅向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b00975e146fda3088bd5c4076fb05d3ebc9f820983037cbef50ac2fad1a4538",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "920041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a14911c15855d7a40e71535c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段发动技能时\n一段时间内速度稍微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8e9a1e20126cec09d902fdef79a3617bc5786e5ef17ed3d4403188a6b16da08",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "920051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50feab2f0ef42838a3587f60",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中间点附近位于中团时\n稍微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5c819012f498cb5a237f7826af10728e47a72a25b32b438671cb44858c8d71a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "920061"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:905793021f7498feb78c6e08",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "中距离或长距离比赛的最终弯道往后\\n在后方准备超越对手时速度稍微提升\\n如果出闸时起跑慢了\\n变为速度少量提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a0d9c65a3170e7f99a631c37240c4444e42495e0d040f626d3987b6e4d59d45",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "920071"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86b31e2c4e7d53f775941b94",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘迫近的某处位于中团时\n持续一段时间略微提升速度\n<作战·先行>",
      "source_fingerprint": "994468e1328e049b3b5e43d7a422fef1e3bf5ff2058816eda5f77344989fd35a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "920101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8adfb3f3265d5c18ae19af96",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛后半段位于中团\\n当试图超越或被接近时\\n在剩余400米处速度会略微提升\\n如果是非标准距离的比赛则会少量提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "500815cff8a2b50996539110a1ad34f04416c6472d4dfd8e5db28a720434f118",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "920111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fafc5dc801fcabd120c1a58c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段位于前方时\\n根据剩余体力展开长距离冲刺\\n速度持续性微量上升",
      "source_fingerprint": "49bbd20fc0e9ef4651942f045a835aff09dfae18870f42691f51038b63ca2ca9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "920131"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:763cc034a123f2901f6c0b73",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘的某个时刻若位于前方\\n则短时间内小幅向前突进＜领放・草地＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4dcc7f3ff2784d7994c0a941eebece6389e998027e0569e4904c541ffc48ba5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "920201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5eb8526c08397f8d841b3707",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赛事中盘初期在前列进行名次争夺时\\n速度少量提升＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "a56d785d84bbfb696fdce45ef717577a1b1d256f64017bab1f0530043854631a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "920221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6d95779ea9ffface79fc7e3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛进行到中间位置若自身位于前方\\n则速度稍微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "04585ab3929ad7bb3fe2b3940a11eb12432586862dd6f785265e59c833bcb78e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "920231"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ade6c2784d9332d20f058429",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛进入中盘后位于第一名或者是\\n位于前三名准备超越时\\n少量回复耐力并向前略微持续突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "32aaf17bb0fe6023161c8085e75d5af833518b648d94c1da79b6c116c7b13fd1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "920241"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b0be31136e29ba30c14f942",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘极小幅回复耐力\\n＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "7801437208452c02b22d637f2bce126fb537d48ba2ac2b955fedeeba328df3ee",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "920251"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e484499950afd8761945101c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在终盘的最终弯道位于前方时\\n速度稍微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "7855f3e128c62538971e219f1328c0f8ed68b90d3f96a799be14c4e28b67467c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "920301"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:813d7f4576ba94081ec063c2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近中盘时若位于前方\\n则速度极少量提升\\n若是中距离比赛则之后\\n在中盘的直线处速度略微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "287b94d1654e71644d741f29c08abae2fb22c47f6c3702a0f74be13a3973eccb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "920311"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50d0a075f9d642664953d7dc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在终盘的最终弯道以及往后位于前方时\\n短时间内速度少量提升,如果是\\n中距离比赛则改变效果\\n短时间内向前小幅突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "09d04d771e410b4b929d1f7a9501a66bbb7d99770bd259bb31866545c58eb420",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "920321"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f774a0e54c89ed2289bf79a0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若比赛中盘在队伍中间位置超越过对手\\n则在第三弯道时短时间内稍微提升速度\\n如果是2400ｍ的比赛且自身高人气\\n则持续稍微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "33c8108453d1d07f39e6ea5fcbdb71491f05fedf48ec94b49fc69a7b8e2315ba",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "920351"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a1fafc08e2b8687e4e8023e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若在中距离比赛的最终弯道\\n位于队伍中间,则稍微向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b15a61fed5491897b66f31767aaeb209fba6271634fd67a43b34feace16238c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "920371"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a369528471feaa959e1ee21",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛的半程左右若位于中间位置\\n则短时间内速度略微提升,之后若在终盘的弯道进行过竞争,则在剩余350m的位置短时间内速度少量提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "afb003537994d841fb74083c85ebc9528e00ae4dc2ec06b8c9457e4924709e9d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "920401"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d1b411250aeeeba750d9b70",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中间位置时若身处前方\\n一段时间内速度微幅提升\\n若为短距离比赛,则一段时间内\\n微幅向前突进＜领放/先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9af1ce8df0989f58ff69940107ecf964299be02dbce227d77aabd4d14f9fe0e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "920411"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5dbc352d29ab0fbc4d6a0f8a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若在比赛中盘的弯道处位于有利位置\\n则回复微量体力\\n若是中长距离比赛\\n则额外极少量持续提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "f576ba07fe7af5ab47b0d50db20380957fca6c98b8a12051540f783870a6a056",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "920451"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc966ad80d6d7a9036cecdc5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛后半段速度会略微提升＜沙土＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "07f3404b37bbf622e035c2fa21c85e2e908a584884687109f623a49fb876e6b3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "920461"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54678d01c11aaa6f7c5f3679",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "中盘以后在下坡路段处于中间集团，则下坡后\\n将在较长时间内持续极小幅提升速度\\n＜中距离/长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "50f701c09ff806fb3d9c64cf2ffdf213499d84405271831d28b93c77e8b07468",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "920481"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:397a2161f913183799210da5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘的弯道位于后方时\\n若距离终点尚远则短时间内小幅向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "e25e554749241f5a35e845f434a13b075a4ae6779887029b4257fcfc0329a79f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "920501"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d47049348b7315cf1f52879",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在终盘的最终弯道及往后,自身位于中后方时\\n一段时间内速度少量提升\\n若是中距离比赛则改变效果\\n一段时间内小幅向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "cee98cef60b742c25c799f64c5722326f0645438ece4c3e64231a9a95c140a83",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "920601"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0016def032358fb6d5de668c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若比赛进入最后600m,并在队伍中间\\n从外道超越对手,则最终冲刺的关键时刻\\n会持续微量提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d9936c87a229709894aceb6fd0c4c03d234ce54f1a16dc5f937edf9db312558",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "920611"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4afec1166720435041470bd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近终盘的某处位于队伍中间时\\n速度略微提升,若是中距离比赛\\n则提升技能效果",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ba14c04fbb7afe51436103f1fa55fe5dde5017d6fae8c7d51fcdb684a3d33d0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "920671"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9965daf9f93202a01bea9d7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "序盘以及中盘在前方被超越或进行竞争时\\n短时间内稍微提升速度,若是长距离比赛\\n则在比赛后半段位于前二名时\\n速度极少量持续提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f2a4ac46d2382a1965fcee630a024486330f4a816d10fb6ff35763bcff11131",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "920681"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4adba86e9a8d1b71673cbaa2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "进入终盘后的最终直线上若位于队伍中间,则速度\\n稍微提升,此外若是中距离或长距离\\n比赛且在中盘被超越过的话\\n极小幅向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb5dc2341b66e29da0868630338717a327ae91960b30f0b560cabe71c35a56f0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "920741"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f7791c548c3b90bb6df5b3d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "通过技能回复3次以上耐力时\\n在紧临终盘前的位置稍微向前突进\\n＜先行・长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "407ecbbf30007d84269b92071b3f0aabdea13790499c46c71bec0def6d69f32e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "920771"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e111a8fda8617667e191c8ab",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若是三后冠的赛道\\n则在终盘的弯道短时间内稍微向前突进\\n如果此时为下坡,则额外略微提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "06c79f3c0b1ef3126ffa1cf94ab1e89c51c37738379596a681e3a631f1a7a7da",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "92111091"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba3ab504f5aba4bf142c7a48",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "获得2个仅能抵御一次干劲下降的\\n状态",
      "source_fingerprint": "686817b2342777a0ee6fd0dbf9b5adfe21bf8ff3d9f95246e17aa3442c415949",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "480",
        "1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81c099438e56076751bf9c0d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "获得1个仅能抵御一次不良状态的\\n状态",
      "source_fingerprint": "6933f9e7855f4f30a819184e9d1dcdfd27124e3c19a199721a0fcf72a0a23a64",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "480",
        "2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3793e87ddf7b518a100570d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中可再挑战的次数\\n增加10次",
      "source_fingerprint": "4dadb38f7ea1d32e70c559cf939297c9b3da9ab4be663ae8d6982cdaaba61afc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "480",
        "3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c59cfc03b3a2fc61200d732c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "获得因子时，从获取候选中包含的\\n未获得通用因子中随机获得\\n最多3个",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b0c8b91790b7262ceced51982d2d842fbd8bce82f26dc8bc852e508ca68199f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "480",
        "4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e57e16508d9527418134aa36",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "获得因子时，从获得的★1・★2因子\\n中随机将最多5个强化为★3",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f7ba55e76388fb976e02c3e098420f3ee4b6097967c5c54132d304dd829e69f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "480",
        "5"
      ]
    },
    {
